SUMMARY:TDRR #3 Weekday Morning Ride\, Pedal to Preserve Short (20R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Lynn Pfeil\nCelebr
 ate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to the e
 vent. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Riding ou
 r Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose Page](h
 ttps://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module
 _id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR Schedul
 e](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mo
 dule_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes.lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/cue/dh-pedal-to-preserve-short-20r/)\n\nTour de Red Rose 
 & LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes an
 d Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!for
 um/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmet
 s are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meet
 up Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lan
